OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy for
OL,6,Fsome overnight however, clear spells
OL,7,Fwill develop, mainly across southern
OL,8,Fparts of the region. There is also a
OL,9,Fchance of a little light rain in the
OL,10,Ffar north.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy, particularly across
OL,13,Fthe north of the region, it will turn
OL,14,Fbrighter with lengthy sunny spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping. Feeling very warm in the
OL,16,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
