OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FRemaining largely dry over the coming
OL,7,Fdays with plenty of sunshine. Very
OL,8,Fwarm, with temperatures rising further
OL,9,Fand becoming hot locally by Wednesday.
OL,10,FIsolated showers on Thursday, though
OL,11,Fcooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
